  "title": "Physical Operating-Condition-Guided Vision-Language Matching for Cavitation Diagnosis in Industrial Pipeline Systems",
  "summary": "This report introduces a physical operating-condition-guided vision-language matching (POC-VLM) framework for cavitation diagnosis, addressing the challenge of varying acoustic responses across industrial pipeline systems. POC-VLM dynamically aligns physical semantics with observed acoustic signals using a time-frequency-conditioned text adaptation module, achieving improved performance over traditional methods. The framework also demonstrates the complementary roles of vision-language semantic matching and physical operating-condition priors.",
